# RedStar/Wega #117 boss rewards restored for the Whiskey Lavaland port.

ent-LavalandCrateNecropolisAshDrakeFilled = necropolis chest
    .desc = A reinforced chest containing one of the Ash Drake's treasures.
ent-LavalandCrateNecropolisColossusFilled = necropolis chest
    .desc = A reinforced chest containing the Colossus's treasures.
ent-LavalandCrateNecropolisBubblegumFilled = necropolis chest
    .desc = A reinforced chest containing Bubblegum's treasures.
ent-LavalandBossBubblegumSecondLife = Bubblegum, unbound
    .desc = Its destroyed body was only a door. Here, in its private blood-soaked arena, the slaughter demon is fully enraged.

ent-GemHollowCrystal = hollow crystal
    .desc = A blue crystal that shines with an inner void.
ent-GemBloodStone = blood stone
    .desc = A red stone still pulsing with Bubblegum's rage.
ent-ClothingOuterArmorHostileEnv = H.E.C.K. suit
    .desc = An experimental kinetic suit designed for survival in exceptionally hostile environments.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHostileEnv = H.E.C.K. helmet
    .desc = An experimental helmet designed for survival in exceptionally hostile environments.
ent-BloodContract = blood contract
    .desc = A demonic warrant that marks one nearby living person for death. Its curse is powerful, visible and temporary.
ent-ActionBloodContractMark = Write the blood contract
    .desc = Mark a nearby living humanoid for two minutes. The contract is consumed on success.
ent-LavaStaffRod = staff of lava
    .desc = The power of fire and stone is in your hands.
ent-BottleDragonBlood = bottle of dragon blood
    .desc = Its unstable power permanently changes whoever drinks it.
ent-DivineVocalCordsImplant = divine vocal cords
    .desc = An implant carrying the voice of an ancient god. A forceful command can knock nearby creatures down.
ent-WeaponSpectralBlade = spectral blade
    .desc = A dull blade that grows stronger by stealing the souls of humanoids slain with it.
ent-WeaponSpellBlade = spellblade
    .desc = A blade able to launch a small reserve of self-recharging arcane bolts.
ent-LegionCore = legion core
    .desc = A fading organic core capable of rapidly restoring damaged tissue.
ent-ChemistryBottleStabilizingSerum = stabilizing serum bottle
    .desc = A reagent formulated to preserve a living legion core.
ent-MobLowerAshDrake = ash drake
    .desc = A lesser draconic form carrying a fraction of the Necropolis guardian's power.
ent-BecomeToDrakeAction = become ash drake
    .desc = Reveal your draconic form.
ent-DrakeReturnBackAction = return from ash drake form
    .desc = Return to your original form.

reagent-name-stabilizing-serum = stabilizing serum
reagent-desc-stabilizing-serum = A specialized preservative for unstable organic artifacts.
reagent-effect-guidebook-stabilize-legion-core = Stabilizes an active legion core on contact.
legion-core-inert = The legion core has gone inert.

spectral-blade-call = The blade calls into the dead. {$ghosts} ghosts currently answer.
spectral-blade-examine = [color=mediumpurple]It holds {$stolen} stolen souls and is empowered by {$orbiting}/{$maximum} orbiting ghosts.[/color]
dragon-blood-effect-1 = The blood burns away your flesh, leaving only bone.
dragon-blood-effect-2 = Lava no longer harms or slows you.
dragon-blood-effect-3 = You feel a draconic form waiting beneath your skin.
dragon-blood-effect-4 = New glands burn in your throat. You can breathe fire.

ent-LavalandCrateNecropolisBloodDrunkMinerFilled = necropolis chest
    .desc = A reinforced chest containing the Blood-drunk Miner's recovered weapons.
ent-LavalandCrateNecropolisDemonicFrostMinerFilled = necropolis chest
    .desc = A reinforced chest containing one of the Demonic Frost Miner's cursed artifacts.
ent-WeaponCleavingSaw = cleaving saw
    .desc = Closed, it attacks rapidly and causes bleeding; opened, it sweeps a wide arc and bites deeply into megafauna.
ent-WeaponWildhunterKnife = Wildhunter knife
    .desc = A masterwork harvesting knife that can cut a trophy into a finite cache of materials.
ent-WeaponBloodDrunkKineticAccelerator = custom kinetic accelerator
    .desc = The Blood-drunk Miner's meticulously tuned kinetic accelerator.
ent-DemonicResurrectionCrystal = demonic resurrection crystal
    .desc = Absorb its ward to return from one death in a shadow-touched body.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsCursedIce = cursed ice boots
    .desc = They bind to the wearer and can leave a temporary trail of treacherous ice.
ent-WeaponDemonicJackhammer = demonic jackhammer
    .desc = A life-stealing excavation tool built to pulverize rock and throw living targets aside.
ent-IceEnergyCrystal = ice energy crystal
    .desc = A frozen matrix holding the power of the Demonic Frost Miner's second life.
ent-TrophyDemonicFrostMinerIceTalisman = ice-block talisman
    .desc = A crusher trophy that traps a marked target in supernatural ice.
ent-ClothingOuterArmorGodslayer = Godslayer armour
    .desc = Once every ten minutes, it restores its wearer from critical injury or death.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetGodslayer = Godslayer helm
    .desc = A sealed helm built to survive the Necropolis's strongest guardians.
ent-ActionToggleCursedIceBoots = Toggle cursed ice trail
    .desc = Allow or suppress the cursed boots' slippery ice trail.
ent-LavalandBossDemonicFrostMiner = demonic frost miner
    .desc = An ancient miner consumed by a cold far crueler than Lavaland's heat.
ent-MobBloodDrunkMinerGuidance = blood-drunk miner of Guidance
    .desc = A fallen explorer whose melee strikes restore his body.
ent-MobBloodDrunkMinerHunter = blood-drunk miner of the Hunter
    .desc = A fallen explorer specialized in long and frequent pursuit dashes.
ent-MobBloodDrunkMinerDoom = blood-drunk miner of Doom
    .desc = A slow, relentless explorer whose nearly continuous dashes make distance meaningless.
ent-ActionDemonicFrostOrbs = Frost orb barrage
    .desc = Launch a spreading fan of demonic frost orbs.
ent-ActionDemonicFrostMachineGun = Snowball fusillade
    .desc = Sustain a rapid stream of freezing projectiles at one target.
ent-ActionDemonicFrostShotgun = Demonic ice blast
    .desc = Fire a broad, high-damage cone of ice shards.

